<title>UK: U.S. Lucent to join MSCI indices on Oct 30.</title>
<headline>U.S. Lucent to join MSCI indices on Oct 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies Inc will be added to Morgan Stanley Capital International's indices from October 1, MSCI said in a statement.</p>
<p>Lucent will finally be spun off from AT&amp;T Corp on September 30, although 17.6 percent of the company is already trading after an initial public offer in April.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T plans to split into three publicly traded companies, its core telecommunications services, Lucent, a telecoms equipment company and commuting company NCR Corp.</p>
<p>The MSCI indices are used by fund managers to allocate assets and measure performance.</p>
<p>-- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
